## Hero Idea

I think I finally came up with a much better idea for the Hero section.

Instead of showing everything as soon as the page loads, I want the Hero to change as the user scrolls.

The page will first show the title, description and buttons.

As the user scrolls, the Hero content will become smaller and move to the left side while the cards appear on the right with smooth animations.

The dashboard will stay fixed at the bottom and slightly overlap the cards. The cards will rotate around it, and whenever a different card comes to the front, the dashboard will update to show that card's information.

For now, I'll keep the dashboard blank because later I want to replace it with an actual screenshot from inside the VetMate app. I think using a real screenshot will make the landing page look much more trustworthy.

